# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform
# does locally. Godot's own generated .gitattributes carries the same first line;
# a Windows contributor's CRLF would otherwise reach a .gd or .tscn and diff the
# whole file. Measured 2026-09-07: no tracked file carried CRLF, so this changes
# no committed byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never normalised or diffed as text.
*.glb binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
